# The govox-py commit this port is a port OF.
#
# Single source of truth. Every tool that reads govox-py — the golden-corpus
# generator above all — resolves this, never a branch tip and never whatever
# happens to be checked out.
#
# Why pin at all: govox-py is under active development. The M2 correction
# parity harness generates its expected values BY RUNNING govox-py, so an
# unpinned reference means the corpus silently re-baselines itself against
# whatever landed that afternoon, and a genuine divergence looks like a passing
# test.
#
# Moving the pin is a deliberate, reviewable act: bump the SHA here, regenerate
# the corpus, and read the resulting diff. A corpus diff with no pin change is a
# bug in govox-rs; a corpus diff WITH a pin change is govox-py's behaviour
# moving, and each hunk needs a decision recorded in docs/parity.md.

# Values are quoted so this file stays `source`-able from sh: the subject line
# contains parentheses, which are shell syntax.
GOVOX_PY_COMMIT="3ad8c0fb07b25972628f9ae4e4ac9943fde08507"
GOVOX_PY_DATE="2026-08-13"
GOVOX_PY_BRANCH="develop"
GOVOX_PY_SUBJECT="fix(overlay): actually call _capture_app_rule at session start"

# Default location of the govox-py checkout. Override with GOVOX_PY_REPO.
GOVOX_PY_REPO_DEFAULT="../govox-py"
